From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: m5agent <m5agent@m5stack.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] hw/esp32: add multi-peer ESP-NOW fabric replay state

Add an opt-in controller mode used by a three-guest ESP-NOW fabric
broker. Each controller encrypts with its configured synthetic peer MAC
before transmission, preserves the broker-supplied transmitter address on
RX, and keeps the authenticated 64-frame replay window scoped to the
source peer MAC. The existing direct two-guest bridge keeps its address
compatibility path and the fabric remains a shared-LMK test lane.

Signed-off-by: m5agent <m5agent@m5stack.com>
---
